# The five OMG BPMN 2.0.2 XSDs are never versioned: they are downloaded from omg.org and their SHA-256 is
# verified (packages/bim-core/hatch_build.py, tools/xsd_inventory.py --ensure). Wheels, sdists, the SDK and the
# images do carry them. `tools/xsd_inventory.py --check` fails if Git lists them or does not ignore them.
/packages/bim-core/src/bim_core/resources/vendor/omg/bpmn/2.0.2/*.xsd
